{
  "slug": "visual-test-pro",
  "name": "Visual Test Pro",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Visual Test Pro is a Claude Code plugin that visually tests your entire app in Chrome, catches security vulnerabilities, handles authentication automatically, and delivers a plain English report your non-technical co-founder could read.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **24 commands**.\n\n- **Commands** (24): `addaccount` (Manually save test account details for a project), `atlas-check` (Check for regressions and design consistency only), `atlas-feature` (Run the post-feature checklist for a specific feature), `atlas-map` (Full Atlas codebase scan — rebuild the complete product brain map), `atlas-quick` (Quick Atlas refresh — update context and tell me what to do next), `atlas` (Master orchestrator and product brain), `compass-feature` (Evaluate a specific feature idea using the PRISM-PV framework), `compass-project` (Full market validation for a new project idea), and 16 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install visual-test-pro@claude-community` from `Kidkujoe/Visual-Test-Pro`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
